  "intuition": "Adjusted the pairwise gap weight scaling parameters to enhance focus on significant objective gaps while maintaining stability. Increased clamp bounds and scaled the tau hyperparameter for finer control over weights, promoting better preference differentiation.",
  "hyperparams": {
    "geometry_family": "dense_all_pairs",
